":330,"hash":331,"mime":42,"name":332,"path":5,"size":333,"width":116,"height":67},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_PHOTO_2025_01_16_20_24_44_9c4e8a53e7.jpg","thumbnail_PHOTO_2025_01_16_20_24_44_9c4e8a53e7","thumbnail_PHOTO-2025-01-16-20-24-44.jpg",6.04,"PHOTO_2025_01_16_20_24_44_9c4e8a53e7",375.43,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002FPHOTO_2025_01_16_20_24_44_9c4e8a53e7.jpg","2025-03-12T09:22:47.705Z",{"id":339,"attributes":340},199,{"start_date":341,"title":342,"content":343,"excerpt":5,"slug":344,"end_date":341,"tags":21,"createdAt":345,"updatedAt":345,"event_categories":346,"image":350},"2025-01-11","《底層邏輯》讀書會-第三回","\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"\u003E《底層邏輯》讀書會-第三回\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E若只教你方法，是「授人以魚」；\u003Cbr\u003E若教你底層邏輯，是「授人以漁」。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E讓我們一起細味知名商業顧問劉潤的暢銷著作《底層邏輯》，翻開生活、事業、人脈以至時間管理的底牌，洞察事物的本質，直搗問題的核心，作出正確的決定。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：1月11日(星期六)\u003Cbr\u003E時間：12:00-14:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：佐敦吳松街186號Plato餐廳\u003Cbr\u003E費用：至少消費一杯飲品\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E分享內容：個體進化的底層邏輯\u003Cbr\u003E1. 哪些事情是你實現人生目標必須做的？\u003Cbr\u003E2. 最可怕的能力是甚麼？\u003Cbr\u003E3. ⁠最可怕的效率是甚麼？\u003Cbr\u003E4. ⁠最可怕的槓杆是甚麽？\u003Cbr\u003E5. ⁠是時間管理你，還是你管理時間？\u003Cbr\u003E6. ⁠有價值的人脈是如何建立？\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","reading-logic-250111","2025-03-12T09:21:30.042Z",{"data":347},[348],{"id":19,"attributes":349},{"name":21,"slug":22,"description":5,"createdAt":23,"updatedAt":23},{"data":351},{"id":352,"attribu